### Authentication
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "<UTILISATEUR>",
  "password": "<MOT_DE_PASSE>"
}

### Create Evaluation (requires token from above)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pedagogie/evaluations/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

{
  "eleve": 1,
  "matiere": 1,
  "classe": 1,
  "trimestre": 1,
  "type_eval": "INT",
  "coefficient": 1,
  "note_sur_20": 14.5,
  "date_eval": "2026-05-12"
}

### List Evaluations
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pedagogie/evaluations/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

### Retrieve Single Evaluation
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pedagogie/evaluations/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

### Update Evaluation
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pedagogie/evaluations/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

{
  "note_sur_20": 16.75
}
